{"availability":"available","full":"hackerstudent29/Zenify","name":"Zenify","description":"Open-source music streaming app with synced multilingual lyrics, a glassmorphic UI and a native Flutter mobile app. Built with Next.js, Fastify and Prisma.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-02-17T15:41:37Z","updated":"2026-10-11T18:06:35Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://listenzenify.vercel.app","topics":["android","apple-music-ui","audio-player","fastify","flutter","glassmorphism","lyrics","music-library","music-player","music-streaming","nextjs","open-source","prisma","spotify-alternative","synced-lyrics","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://listenzenify.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:57.967Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:57.967Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:57.967Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T06:29:57.967Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js","Node.js","Flutter"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Zenify is an open-source web music player and ad-free Spotify alternative created for music lovers who appreciate clean visuals, instant playback, and native synchronized lyrics for Indian and global regional languages.","Commercial music apps often treat non-English lyrics as an afterthought—showing unsynced blocks of text or missing romanized words entirely. Zenify features a custom karaoke-grade lyric alignment engine, a hardware-accelerated Studio Audio DSP Suite (3-band EQ, 8D spatial sound, nightcore/slowed modes), an in-browser local audio player, and a dynamic liquid glass UI that flows with your album's colors.","🎧 Start listening immediately in your browser: Visit listenzenify.vercel.app — no account or download required!"],"features":["🎤 Sub-Second Synced Lyrics: Real-time karaoke alignment for Tamil, Tanglish, Hindi, Malayalam, and English with smart protection during instrumental guitar and violin solos ([